# The four 4-operator connections on the OPL3: pairs 0/3 in bank 0 and
# 9/12 in bank 1, enabled through 0x104, each connection chosen by bit 0
# of 0xC0 and 0xC3 (and 0x1C0 and 0x1C3). Feedback on operator 1 and the
# pan bits on the first channel of each pair. The pair is then split back
# into two 2-operator channels.
